WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:09.330
Give a person another role, check their effective access, and see why they can or cannot open a page.

2
00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:13.420
Open the person whose access you want to change.

3
00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:24.120
The role card shows their current role. Built-in roles follow the rank; custom roles follow their permission grid.

4
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.940
Choose the new role.

5
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:34.730
Save. Nobody can give more than they hold, and sensitive changes can need a second administrator's approval.

6
00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:41.930
Effective access shows the final result for every module, and where each level comes from.

7
00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:49.750
Use the tester on this page to ask: can this person open a given address, and if not, why?
